                                                "sense_id": "9fe311b5-2e46-3d38-9660-2292080cb3eb",
                                                "text": "She picked up an apple which had a rich cidery smell and tossed it over the fence into the orchard, where it landed with a plop and smelled even more cidery […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f28f5af-9d13-4241-994e-974284794f67",
                                                "sense_id": "9fe311b5-2e46-3d38-9660-2292080cb3eb",
                                                "text": "The more he heard of fumbled passes, cidery kisses and snapped straps, the more he knew better than to risk such humiliation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "cidery",
